Food Insecurity Experience Score is method developed by FANTA}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\insrsid12591899 \hich\af0\dbch\af31505\loch\f0  (Food and Nutrition Technical Assistance)}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\insrsid11276785 
\hich\af0\dbch\af31505\loch\f0 
 to measure the food security status of the household. It consists of eight questions that asses the food insecurity status over the period of 1 year. Since it is a subjective measure of food insecurity, it is necessary to verify that the respondents were
\hich\af0\dbch\af31505\loch\f0  uniform in their response to each question. }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\insrsid11276785\charrsid13583016 \hich\af0\dbch\af31505\loch\f0 The validity of the }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\insrsid11276785 
\hich\af0\dbch\af31505\loch\f0 response}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\insrsid11276785\charrsid13583016 \hich\af0\dbch\af31505\loch\f0  for the Food Insecurity Experience Score (FIES) was done using the Rasch model}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f0\insrsid11276785 \hich\af0\dbch\af31505\loch\f0  u\hich\af0\dbch\af31505\loch\f0 sing the entire sample of 4959 households}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\insrsid11276785\charrsid13583016 \hich\af0\dbch\af31505\loch\f0 
. The severity index suggests that the lack of healthy food to eat was the least severe food insecurity phenomenon. Going throughout the day without eating having anything to eat was the most severe. The infit score for all the question was below 1.2. Thi
\hich\af0\dbch\af31505\loch\f0 s suggest that there was no anomaly in the response to the question of FIES. The Rasch reliability was 76.17%. Since the Rasch Reliability is greater than 70% we can be assured the questions of FIES was answered prop
\hich\af0\dbch\af31505\loch\f0 erly by the respondent and there was uniformity in the response}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\insrsid11276785 .}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\insrsid11276785\charrsid11276785 
